# Generated estimation outputs, excluded because of size. GitHub rejects files
# over 100 MB, and these two are ~2 GB and ~570 MB. Both are regenerated by
# run_replication.m (see README, "Replication and reproducibility").
tblResults_SlopeCoefficients_Level_SmoothL.mat
gdpResults_AllCoefficients_Levels5.mat

# Epoch-sensitivity extension outputs. Regenerated in about a minute each by
# GDP results/gdp_GreatMod.m and GDP results/gdp_ModernEra.m.
gdpResults_GreatMod.mat
gdpResults_ModernEra.mat

# Scratch files written by run_replication.m while it patches the authors'
# files at run time. The originals are restored as soon as each script finishes,
# so anything left here means a run was interrupted.
system_toggles.mat
*_backup.m

# macOS
.DS_Store

# MATLAB transient files
*.asv
*.m~
crash_dumps/
